{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rszfe7","slide":1,"text":"Welcome to Emergency Operations Decision Room. This lesson begins with one principle: emergency intelligence must connect verified evidence to authorized action. We will connect that principle to an accountable health decision and make it testable in the companion notebook.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N13, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
