{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/v9t83z","slide":3,"text":"These five controls form one operating chain. We begin with verified signal, move through severity and capacity, and finish with action owner and closure. Every control must be explicit, reviewable, and owned.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N13, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
