{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/87a9cjed","slide":4,"text":"THE SYSTEM MAY","textPreview":"THE SYSTEM MAY","textChars":14,"textLines":1,"bbox":[855,220,275,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/elsfihcr","slide":4,"text":"Generate evidence\nFlag uncertainty\nRoute authorized review","textPreview":"Generate evidence | Flag uncertainty | Route authorized review","textChars":58,"textLines":3,"bbox":[855,270,270,105]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zm1grmtc","slide":4,"text":"It may not authorize the consequential action.","textPreview":"It may not authorize the consequential action.","textChars":46,"textLines":1,"bbox":[855,390,270,44]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/88bj20","slide":4,"text":"Consider this health example. An incident brief links severity, resources, owners, review times, and escalation. The platform may organize evidence, flag uncertainty, and route a case for authorized review. It may not take the consequential action on its own.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N13, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
