{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/m2epi9","slide":5,"text":"The notebook converts the lesson into executable evidence. Build and validate an emergency decision brief and operating queue. As you review the saved outputs, focus on what the evidence supports, what remains uncertain, and the condition that requires abstention or escalation.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N13, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
