{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qg8b7p","slide":8,"text":"Before deployment, ask five questions. Is verified signal clear? Is severity documented? Is capacity testable? Is action owner governed? And is closure explicit? If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer the system for review.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N13, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}